{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的S13把Y中“明知谁也没法答应永远”这一关键心理原因弱化了，改成“越喜欢越觉得时间过得快”，使他想收回心意的动机不如Y清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更适合边听边扫：重点词加亮后容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么，话与感受纵向交替、感受按音乐时点出现，也减少了同时处理两栏信息的负担。感受部分X的音乐性、身体感和画面变化更细腻，能感到情绪如何随乐句推进；但Y的完整叙述在解释人物动机、连接前后心理变化方面更扎实，尤其S06、S11、S13的因果关系更清楚。综合实际观看体验，我选X，但它牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20299e56-0280-4699-ab78-c364cf8841a7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193534887894Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:37:03.032694+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f2bceb23a383ce4305972d5def19f3a62429c05bd0a1be4e0835cda2333d0cf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha